{c: Verse 1}
[F]O ho de re [A#]na [Gm],        De re [F]na
Ra ra [A#]ra [Gm],        [F]Kajle ton zyada kaale
[Dm]Lagde ne eh ujaale,        [A#]Tere bin oh ve mah [F]iya
[F]Thandiyan hawawan aayiaan,        [Dm]Neendran udaa le gayiaan
[A#]Akh na eh sove ma [F]hiya,        [F]Teriya vich jag [Dm]di ra [A#]hi mai taan
[A#]Taareyan de [Gm]saath [C]ve,        Chan [F]kitthan guzari [A#]oye [C]
O chan [F]kitthan guzari oye [C]raat ve,        Sachi [A#]dass de jaa eh [Gm]baat ve
Chan [F]dino? zara mehs [C]oos taa kar,        [A#]Mere naina di bars [C]aat [Gm]ve
Chan [F]kitthan guzari oye,        Chan [F]kitthan guzari oye [C]raat [F]ve
[F]Tutte taareyan ton [Dm]mangna main ki ve,        [A#]Tere naal mera [C]lagna ae jee ve
[F]Tutte taareyan ton [Dm]mangna main ki ve,        [A#]Tere naal mera [C]lagna ae jee ve
[F]Tere bin mere [Dm]saah nahi chalne,        [A#]Ik tere vich meri [C]hai zindagi ve
Chann [F]bani na tu path [Dm]aran di [A#]tarah,        Kade [A#]samajh mere jaz [C]baat ve
Chan [F]kitthan guzari oye,        Ho chan [F]kitthan guzari oye [C]raat [F]ve
[F]Channa haaye,        [F]Tere khayalan di [Dm]tasveer leke
[A#]Vekhan tere raste [C]raahan utte beh ke,        [F]Bhull gaya tu vi [Dm]waade tere
[A#]Aavega tu chheti chheti,        [C]Gaya si eh keh ke
